|\n\n### ModelBehaviorError\n\nBases: `AgentsException`\n\nException raised when the model does something unexpected, e.g. calling a tool that doesn't exist, or providing malformed JSON.\n\n Source code in `src/agents/exceptions.py`\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| ```  66 67 68 69 70 71 72 73 74 75 ``` | ``` class ModelBehaviorError(AgentsException): class  ModelBehaviorError(AgentsException): \"\"\"Exception raised when the model does something unexpected, e.g. calling a tool that doesn't  \"\"\"Exception raised when the model does something unexpected, e.g. calling a tool that doesn't exist, or providing malformed JSON.  exist, or providing malformed JSON.  \"\"\"  \"\"\"   message: str message: str   def __init__(self, message: str): def  __init__(self, message: str): self.message = message self. message = message super().__init__(message) super(). __init__(message) ``` |\n\n### ModelRefusalError\n\nBases: `AgentsException`\n\nException raised when the model refuses to produce the requested output.\n\n Source code in `src/agents/exceptions.py`\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| ```  78 79 80 81 82 83 84 85 86 ``` | ``` class ModelRefusalError(AgentsException): class  ModelRefusalError(AgentsException): \"\"\"Exception raised when the model refuses to produce the requested output.\"\"\"  \"\"\"Exception raised when the model refuses to produce the requested output.\"\"\"   refusal: str refusal: str \"\"\"The refusal text returned by the model.\"\"\"  \"\"\"The refusal text returned by the model.\"\"\"   def __init__(self, refusal: str): def  __init__(self, refusal: str): self.refusal = refusal self. refusal = refusal super().__init__(f\"Model refused to produce output: {refusal}\") super(). __init__(f\"Model refused to produce output: {refusal} \") ``` |\n\n#### refusal `instance-attribute`\n\n```\nrefusal: str = refusal refusal: str str = refusal refusal\n```\n\nThe refusal text returned by the model.\n\n### UserError\n\nBases: `AgentsException`\n\nException raised when t